       See the “NOTES” section of wwggeettcchh(3X).

       All of these functions except wwggeett__wwcchh and uunnggeett__wwcchh may be implemented
       as macros.

       Unlike wwggeettcchh(3X), wwggeett__wwcchh and its variants store the value of the in‐
       put character in an additional _w_c_h  parameter  instead  of  the  return
       value.

       Unlike   uunnggeettcchh,  uunnggeett__wwcchh  cannot  distinguish  function  key  codes
       wwggeett__wwcchh from conventional character codes.  An application  can  over‐
       come  this  limitation  by  pushing function key codes with uunnggeettcchh and
       subsequently checking the return value of wwggeett__wwcchh  for  a  match  with
       KKEEYY__CCOODDEE__YYEESS.

